    "title": "Speaking and interaction practice",
    "subtitle": "Keeping a conversation going",
    "context": "Clarify, soften, correct and politely disagree while keeping the conversation moving.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U30-required-speaking-produce",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Explain the situation",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U30-required-speaking-draft",
            "kind": "production",
            "response": "spoken",
            "prompt": "Keeping a conversation going: Explain the practical problem and your proposed response to an absent partner. State one constraint or condition and explain how it changes the plan.",
            "promptLanguage": "en",
            "context": "老师说了明天见面的时间。十个学生在房间里听，前面的两个人没有听懂。我告诉朋友：“不是大家都听懂了老师说的。”\n\n朋友说：“十个人都没听懂啊？那老师得再说一次。”我说：“不是。我不是说大家都没听懂，而是说有两个人需要再听。”\n\n朋友问：“是哪两个人？我听懂了，明天下午三点。”我说：“坐在前面的两个。他们只听见了三点，不知道是上午还是下午。”\n\n朋友走到前面，说：“明天下午三点，不是上午。”两个人说：“谢谢，现在明白了。”老师问还有谁不明白，没有人再问。\n\n朋友说：“我把你的意思听错了。”我说：“没关系，问一下就明白了。有两个人没听懂，不能说大家都听懂了，也不能说大家都没听懂。”",
            "contextLanguage": "zh",
            "label": "Take your speaking turn",
            "resultDomain": "Self-reviewed speaking practice",
            "rubric": [
              {
                "id": "r1",
                "text": "My problem and proposed response follow the source."
              },
              {
                "id": "r2",
                "text": "I connected a real condition or constraint to the result."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sequential": true
      }
